  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At the critical moment of Wan clan’s immortal battlefield fight against Suan Bu Jin, Wan Liang Han cooperates with Wan Xiao and activates the wisdom path Immortal Gu Wisdom Obstacle. The Gu creates obstacles around the two, protecting them and giving them huge assistance. Fang Yuan, fighting under his Suan Bu Jin identity, then kills Wan Liang Han with the immortal killer move wisdom grasp and takes the corpse.",
        "chapters": [
          1801
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_wan_clan",
          "char_wan_liang_han",
          "char_wan_xiao",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan kills Wan Liang Han before he can destroy his Immortal Gu and takes three from him, two rank six and one rank seven; the rank seven one is Wisdom Obstacle. It has the shape of a snail, dark and occasionally shining with a trace of purple light, and looks quite silly.",
        "chapters": [
          1802
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-spoils",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Activating it can instantly form obstacles in a large range around the Gu Immortal, at a cost of immortal essence and a large amount of will. Many killer moves use it as the core. One such move sends the obstacles into the enemy’s mind so thoughts have trouble colliding and thinking becomes difficult. Fang Yuan treats Immortal Gu like Wisdom Obstacle as only appetizers beside his larger plan after the battle.",
        "chapters": [
          1802
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-spoils",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
